# The server's own runtime state, written wherever it was started. It is a world
# and a player list, not source: the edits, signs, containers and inventories of
# whoever was playing. The server writes them beside the working directory, so a
# run from the repository root leaves them here.
/world.json
/signs.json
/containers.json
/players.json

# Built binaries and logs.
/mcgo
/server
*.log
